---
title: Service Info Endpoint
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Observer
    participant API as FastAPI /service/info
    participant RecSvc as FaceRecognitionService
    participant Embed as EmbeddingRouterAdapter
    participant Hybrid as HybridIndexManager

    Client->>API: GET /api/v0/service/info
    API->>RecSvc: get_service_info()
    RecSvc->>Embed: get_loaded_count()
    RecSvc->>Embed: get_loaded_names()
    RecSvc->>Embed: get_reload_stats()
    Embed->>Hybrid: get_stats()
    Hybrid-->>Embed: entry_count + embedding_count + reload metadata
    Embed-->>RecSvc: aggregated stats
    RecSvc-->>API: model, recognition, embedding, performance, cache blocks
    API-->>Client: 200 OK JSON (includes roster + FAISS stats snapshot)
